[*] --> Task Created
Task Created --> Task Assignment : Create Task
Task Assignment --> Task Assigned : Assign Task
Task Assigned --> Task In Progress : Start Work
Task In Progress --> Task Completed : Complete Task
Task In Progress --> Task Updated : Update Task
Task Updated --> Task Assignment : Re-evaluate Assignment
Task Assigned --> Task Updated : Update Task
Task Updated --> Task Assigned : Update Task
Task Completed --> [*] : Task Complete
